Changelog: 17-10-2026 12:18:12

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/oc (was apps/gpu-oc-bisect) and its package is oc_bisect (was
bc250_gpu_oc_gui): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package named
after the window without the BC-250 prefix; both names are the owner's. With the folder go its key in the portal,
its chapter of the wiki (apps/oc/), its installer test and its release tags: oc-v<x.y.z> from the next release on.
The installed app keeps its name, its launcher bc250-gpu-oc-bisect-gui, the script, its folder under /opt, its
results and settings; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

